{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の朝日新聞 夕刊\n読んでくださいましたか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/06/26/6701430/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"モバメで急遽告知した形ですが\n買いに行くの間に合ったかなー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田家は朝日新聞届くから\n問題なかったんだけども"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"朝日新聞デジタルの方でも読めますので\nよろしくお願いします"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/06/26/6701430/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"http://www.asahi.com/articles/ASJ6P7SJCJ6PUCVL038.html"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さて！\nレポです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日、来てくださったみなさん\n本当にありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/06/26/6701430/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/06/26/6701430/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪型"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1・2部\nストレート"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3～5部\n片寄せ 巻き"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/06/26/6701430/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"衣装"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1部\n命は美しい(さゆりん)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"白と青と黄色の3種類あるけど\n黄色を着ました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生写真の時とかアンダーライブとかでも\nさゆりんの着てたね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/06/26/6701430/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2部\n太陽ノック(伊織)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回の京都個別でも\n太陽ノックの衣装を着てたけど\n形が違うんです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3種類あるけど\n中田がいつも着てるのと違うやつです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/06/26/6701430/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3部\n不等号(まあや)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/06/26/6701430/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"不等号も前回の京都個別で着てたけど\n2種類あって\n中田が普段着てないパターンの衣装です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どっちかと言うと、こっちの方が好きかも"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/06/26/6701430/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4部\nポピパッパパー(まりちゃ)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/06/26/6701430/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポピパも前回着てたね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもこの衣装みんなどこかしら違うから\nなんの衣装か\n一番分かりづらかったかなと思う"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/06/26/6701430/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5部\nハルジオンが咲く頃(かずみん)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これも細かく言うと何種類かあるけど\nざっくり言えばピンクと紫の2種類！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪飾りとかイヤリングとかもあるんだけど\n今日は見当たらなくてつけなかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/06/26/6701430/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あったかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何の曲の歌唱衣装かクイズになりがちですけど\nやっぱり女子が強いなあという印象。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アルバム個別やってると よく思う"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/06/26/6701430/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"会話"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈黙の金曜日\nNOGIBINGO!  中駒姉妹\n乃木中 父の日\n46時間TV\nのぎ天2\n口約束\n欲望のリインカーネーション\n真夏の全国ツアー\nエコパ\nカナヲ\n株\nじょしらく\nアイドル\n総選挙\nゴルフ\n宿題\nブログ、モバメ、755"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"etc."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆにゃんレーンの\nストップウォッチのお姉さんが可愛すぎて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会始まる前に通りすがりにお姉さんに\n可愛いですねって口説いてたら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他のスタッフさん方が気を利かせて\n5部に中田レーンのストップウォッチ係にしてくださいました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"暇な時にたくさん質問してました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お姉さんって言ってるけど\n年下でした！！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/06/26/6701430/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごくタイプでした！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しい握手会でした～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/06/26/6701430/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}